# public/build (Vite output) is intentionally tracked, not ignored: the
# cPanel host has no Node.js, so the compiled assets are committed here and
# pulled as-is rather than built on the server. Run `npm run build` and
# commit the result before every push that touches resources/css or
# resources/js - the server never rebuilds it itself.
